.TH QSCHEMA 1 "2026 April 02" "Qore 2.3" "Qore Programming Language"
.SH NAME
qschema \- database schema management tool
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B qschema
\fIcommand\fP
\fIconnection\fP
\fIschema-file\fP
[\fIoptions\fP]
.PP
.B qschema
\fIcommand\fP
\fIschema-file\fP
[\fIoptions\fP]
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBqschema\fR manages database schemas from YAML (\fB.ysm\fP) or JSON
(\fB.jsm\fP) schema definition files.
It can align a database to match a schema, show differences, validate
schema files, and export existing database schemas.
.SH COMMANDS
.SS "Database Commands (require connection + schema-file)"
.TP
.B align
Align the database to match the schema definition.
.TP
.B drop
Drop all objects defined in the schema from the database.
.TP
.B diff
Show differences between the database and the schema.
.TP
.B export
Export the current database schema to a file.
.SS "File-Only Commands (require schema-file only)"
.TP
.B validate
Validate a schema file for correctness.
.TP
.B info
Display information about the schema file.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-data\-ts =\fIname\fP
Data tablespace name.
.TP
.B \-\-index\-ts =\fIname\fP
Index tablespace name.
.TP
.B \-\-access\-level =\fIlevel\fP
Access level: \fBuntrusted\fP, \fBtrusted\fP (default), or \fBadmin\fP.
.TP
.BR \-f ", " \-\-force
Force the operation without confirmation.
.TP
.BR \-n ", " \-\-dry\-run
Show the SQL that would be executed without running it.
.TP
.BR \-C ", " \-\-no\-color
Disable color output.
.TP
.BR \-v ", " \-\-verbose
Increase verbosity (repeatable).
.TP
.BR \-o ", " \-\-output =\fIfile\fP
Output file (for export).
.TP
.B \-\-format =\fIformat\fP
Export format: \fByaml\fP (default) or \fBjson\fP.
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show help text and exit.
.TP
.BR \-V ", " \-\-version
Show version information and exit.
.SH EXAMPLES
Align a database with a schema:
.RS
.B qschema align mydb schema.ysm
.RE
.PP
Show differences:
.RS
.B qschema diff mydb schema.ysm
.RE
.PP
Dry-run alignment:
.RS
.B qschema align mydb schema.ysm \-n
.RE
.PP
Export a database schema:
.RS
.B qschema export mydb \-o exported.ysm
.RE
.PP
Validate a schema file:
.RS
.B qschema validate schema.ysm
.RE
